## Experience and Lessons
|Case|:**view_and_submit_tips**
   - Failure Analysis1: The test for viewing and submitting tips fails because the submitted tip is not displayed on the dashboard. Existing tips are not being fetched and rendered.
   - Improvement Guidance1: Update the dashboard route to fetch existing tips and display them in `dashboard.html`. This ensures users can confirm their submissions and see all previously submitted tips. Implement this by modifying the dashboard route to include tips data when rendering the page.

   - Error Analysis2: Unable to locate the username field.
   - Improvement Guidance2: Ensure that all user interactions expected by the test cases (such as clicking buttons or entering data) are available in the user interface as per the tests being run. Each element should be present and properly targeted. 
|Case|:**navigate_to_registration**
   - Error Analysis1: Unable to locate link for "Register here."
   - Improvement Guidance1: Ensure that there is a navigation option (either a button or link) clearly available for users wanting to register. This might involve adding a link to the registration form directly on the login page.


